      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GOCCIADORO (9) hasn't appeared since a midfield finish in the Nutrien Final in May, his first time out of the top two. That includes two wins here along with a second in the Gold Crown. Readied with two solid trials and draws for a nice trail so can make a winning return. FLOPPA (1) missed narrowly fresh then overcame a wider barrier and registered a commanding victory last time out, scoring by 6 metres at this circuit and distance. Led there so could take advantage of the ace draw to make it two on the trot. CORZAN DRAMA (2) draws well and could be close to a win after back-to-back placings here, the latest from the second line. CINEMATIC (10) was a beaten favourite when resuming after a year but should be better for the outing so can improve.",
